1
00:03:39,130 --> 00:03:45,130
Unlock the power within.

2
00:07:18,260 --> 00:07:24,260
The Tiger's Apprentice is a animation, family, fantasy
film directed by Raman Hui Shing-Ngai.

3
00:10:57,391 --> 00:11:03,391
After the death of his grandmother, Tom Lee discovers he is part of a
long lineage of magical protectors known as the Guardians.

4
00:14:36,521 --> 00:14:42,521
With guidance from a mythical tiger named Hu and the other Zodiac animal
warriors, Tom trains to take on an evil force that threatens humanity.

5
00:18:15,652 --> 00:18:21,652
Tom Lee (voice), played by Brandon Soo Hoo.

6
00:21:54,782 --> 00:22:00,782
Hu (voice), played by Henry Golding.

7
00:25:33,913 --> 00:25:39,913
Nua Kua / Cynthia (voice), played by Lucy Liu.

8
00:29:13,043 --> 00:29:19,043
Mistral (voice), played by Sandra Oh.

9
00:32:52,173 --> 00:32:58,173
Loo (voice), played by Michelle Yeoh.

10
00:36:31,304 --> 00:36:37,304
Sidney (voice), played by Bowen Yang.

11
00:40:10,434 --> 00:40:16,434
The Tiger's Apprentice is a 2024 American animated fantasy
film based on the 2003 novel by Laurence Yep.

12
00:43:49,565 --> 00:43:55,565
Produced by Paramount Animation and Jane Startz Productions, it is directed by Raman Hui and co-directed by Paul Watling
and Yong Duk Jhun (in their directorial debuts) from a screenplay by David Magee and Christopher Yost.

13
00:47:28,695 --> 00:47:34,695
The film stars the voices of Brandon Soo Hoo, Henry
Golding, Lucy Liu, Sandra Oh, and Michelle Yeoh.

14
00:51:07,826 --> 00:51:13,826
Cartoon Network originally opted to produce a live-action/CG hybrid television film
adaptation of the novel in the late 2000s, but it never came to fruition.

15
00:54:46,956 --> 00:54:52,956
Paramount later acquired the rights for an animated film in
March 2019, with Carlos Baena attached as director.

16
00:58:26,086 --> 00:58:32,086
Mikros Animation provided animation.

17
01:02:05,217 --> 01:02:11,217
Much of the voice cast was revealed between 2020 and 2022,
following Golding's casting in July 2020.

18
01:05:44,347 --> 01:05:50,347
Hui later replaced Baena as director in January 2022.

19
01:09:23,478 --> 01:09:29,478
Steve Jablonsky composed the score.

20
01:13:02,608 --> 01:13:08,608
Originally planned for theatrical release by Paramount Pictures, The Tiger's Apprentice was released on
Paramount+ on February 2, 2024, after being delayed several times due to the COVID-19 pandemic.

21
01:16:41,739 --> 01:16:47,739
The film received mixed reviews from critics.

22
01:20:20,869 --> 01:20:26,869
The film explores themes of tiger, apprentice, based on
children's book, chinese zodiac signs, apprenticeship.
